%description:
Tests the sender SWS avoidance (RFC 9293 section 3.8.6.2.1, MUST-38) and its
override timeout (rule (4)). The server offers 3500 bytes and reads nothing.
After three segments, its window is 500 bytes: less than the MSS, less than all
queued data, and less than half of the largest window (1750). The client holds
the data, and the persist timer, which now also times the override, sends the
500 bytes one RTO later. Then the window is zero, and the client probes it.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 6s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 5000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.srv_tcp.advertisedWindow = 3500
*.srv_app.autoRead=false

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 2500 
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1001:2001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.205 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:3001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.207 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 3001 win 500 
[2.209 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A 3001:3501(500) ack 501 win 16384 
[2.411 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 3501 win 0 
[3.413 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 3501:3502(1) ack 501 win 16384 
[3.415 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 3501 win 0 
[5.413 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A 3501:3502(1) ack 501 win 16384 
[5.415 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 3501 win 0 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Not sending to prevent Silly Window Syndrome.
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
PERSIST timer expired with an open window: overriding the SWS avoidance
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
